DOD
Responsible for:
•	Defining attendance timing
•	Monitoring attendance
•	Handling exceptions
•	Receiving escalation alerts
Patron/Matron
Responsible for:
•	Monitoring assigned students
•	Checking missing students
•	Following up operationally
•	Reviewing attendance exceptions
Biometric Device
Responsible for:
•	Capturing biometric event
•	Sending transaction to system/API
System
Responsible for:
•	Processing transactions
•	Matching students
•	Applying time windows
•	Updating attendance
•	Triggering notifications
•	Maintaining audit logs
