38. DOD Dining Schedule
DOD controls the operational dining timings.
Dining timing may be configured according to:
Option 1 – Dormitory
Example:
Girls Dormitory:
•	Breakfast: 6:30 AM
•	Lunch: 12:30 PM
•	Dinner: 7:00 PM
Boys Dormitory:
•	Breakfast: 6:45 AM
•	Lunch: 12:45 PM
•	Dinner: 7:15 PM
Option 2 – Room
Different rooms may have different dining slots.
Option 3 – Class
Different classes/groups may have different dining slots.
The system should support all three scheduling models.
