40. Dining Attendance
Dining attendance can be manually marked by the relevant Patron/Matron.
The system should display the expected students for that dining session.
The Patron/Matron can mark:
•	Present
•	Not Present
The system should automatically exclude students who are on approved leave.
________________________________________
41. Dining Missing Student Rule
If a student is expected to attend dining but is not present and:
•	Student is not on short leave
•	Student is not on long leave
•	Student is not on medical leave
then the system should trigger an exception.
Notification:
•	Relevant Patron/Matron
•	DOD
•	Parent, according to configured escalation policy
At minimum, DOD and responsible Patron/Matron must be notified.
________________________________________
