46. Security Rules
The following security rules are mandatory:
1.	Student photograph must be available before boarding exit.
2.	Gate Keeper cannot approve leave.
3.	Gate Keeper cannot create leave.
4.	Patron/Matron cannot approve leave requests.
5.	DOD is the final operational approval authority.
6.	Approved leave does not automatically mean physical exit.
7.	Physical exit requires Gate Keeper confirmation.
8.	Return is automatically recorded through biometric attendance.
9.	Manual leave closure should be restricted to authorized exception handling.
10.	Every action must be logged.
________________________________________
47. Role-Based Access Control
DOD
Full Boarding operational control.
Patron/Matron
Access only to assigned dormitories and students.
Gate Keeper
Access only to:
•	Approved exits
•	Student photograph
•	Student identity
•	Exit confirmation
•	Relevant return information
Finance/Accounts Department
Access to:
•	Menu
•	Meal planning
•	Dining configuration
Operational attendance should remain controlled according to school policy.
Parent
Access only to:
•	Their own children
•	Leave requests
•	Leave status
•	Notifications
•	Relevant attendance information
