54. Exception Handling
The system must support exceptions without compromising the normal workflow.
Examples:
Biometric Failure
If a student cannot use biometric due to device/technical failure:
•	Patron/Matron reports exception
•	DOD reviews
•	Authorized manual attendance may be entered
•	Reason is mandatory
•	Manual entry is fully audited
Emergency Exit
DOD should be able to create and approve emergency leave.
Lost/Incorrect Biometric
Student can be temporarily handled through an authorized exception process.
Parent Emergency Request
DOD can create leave directly and approve it.
________________________________________
55. Manual Attendance Restrictions
Manual attendance must not become a replacement for biometric attendance.
Manual attendance should only be available for:
•	Device failure
•	Biometric mismatch
•	Approved operational exception
Manual attendance must require:
•	Reason
•	User identity
•	Timestamp
•	Student
•	Attendance session
