58. Leave State Machine
Recommended backend states:
DRAFT
↓
REQUESTED
↓
PENDING_DOD_APPROVAL
↓
Either:
APPROVED
or
REJECTED
If approved:
APPROVED
↓
AWAITING_PHYSICAL_EXIT
↓
OUTSIDE_SCHOOL
↓
RETURNED
↓
CLOSED
This state model is important because approval, exit and return are three different events.
________________________________________
59. Attendance State Machine
Recommended:
ATTENDANCE_WINDOW_OPEN
↓
BIOMETRIC_TRANSACTION_RECEIVED
↓
ATTENDANCE_RECORDED
At window closure:
ATTENDANCE_COMPLETE
or
ATTENDANCE_MISSING
If missing:
PATRON_DOD_ALERT
↓
